      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Solar Professionals has been aptly named - they are very professional in everything they do.They visited our home and listened to what we needed, asking good clarifying questions. They took me through what was available and helped me to understand the advantages and potential disadvantages of each component.They provided a clear and very detailed quote with information on each component, so that I could do my own independent research.The installation went smoothly. The installers were supremely polite and sought to provide as little disruption to our normal daily routine. My wife runs a business from home and was able to continue with no disruption at all while they were here.Solar Professionals are very responsive and punctual. They were very quick to respond to my initial query and to every other message I sent to them. The solar system was installed with very little time between my initial contact and  the installation being completed.They helped me through all steps in the process of being connected to the grid, monitoring etc.I am VERY impressed and give them my highest recommendation to anyone considering solar.",
